    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/7a172514544c8afd13292cb4a3cbda3a.poster.avif?t=1755121603\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/7a172514544c8afd13292cb4a3cbda3a.webm?t=1755121603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/7a172514544c8afd13292cb4a3cbda3a.mp4?t=1755121603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crypt Robbery is a game that blends elements of shooting and horror, crafted by a solo developer. You can play in two ways: dive into the main story or face off in mini-games like 'Waves of Evil'\u2014a fast-paced challenge with limited time and scarce resources.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/dfa6d2ff3884ce4316223b7983a7303a.poster.avif?t=1755121603\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/dfa6d2ff3884ce4316223b7983a7303a.webm?t=1755121603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/dfa6d2ff3884ce4316223b7983a7303a.mp4?t=1755121603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You play as a man on the edge\u2014burdened by debt, a sick child, and a broken family. Since his wife left, life has fallen into quiet despair. Then, a mysterious letter arrives, signed only 'TG'. One offer: descend into the crypt of Emelin and steal three golden artifacts\u2014in exchange for a life-changing sum of money. With no other choice, he enters the tomb\u2026 and the nightmare begins.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURESSTORY</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Explore creepy places, collect or combine items, read notes and solve puzzles.\u00a0</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/83a52d621412f96ae2ccb92bf102838d.poster.avif?t=1755121603\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/83a52d621412f96ae2ccb92bf102838d.webm?t=1755121603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/83a52d621412f96ae2ccb92bf102838d.mp4?t=1755121603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-<strong>\u00a0\u00a0</strong>Learn when to hide and when to fight, as well as how to fight.\u00a0 </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/004d266f495e78a1c2c05f375a1c89f0.poster.avif?t=1755121603\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/004d266f495e78a1c2c05f375a1c89f0.webm?t=1755121603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/004d266f495e78a1c2c05f375a1c89f0.mp4?t=1755121603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- <strong>Find your way to survive in a dark and unfriendly environment.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/7a172514544c8afd13292cb4a3cbda3a.poster.avif?t=1755121603\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/7a172514544c8afd13292cb4a3cbda3a.webm?t=1755121603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/7a172514544c8afd13292cb4a3cbda3a.mp4?t=1755121603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crypt Robbery is a game that blends elements of shooting and horror, crafted by a solo developer. You can play in two ways: dive into the main story or face off in mini-games like 'Waves of Evil'\u2014a fast-paced challenge with limited time and scarce resources.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/dfa6d2ff3884ce4316223b7983a7303a.poster.avif?t=1755121603\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/dfa6d2ff3884ce4316223b7983a7303a.webm?t=1755121603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/dfa6d2ff3884ce4316223b7983a7303a.mp4?t=1755121603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You play as a man on the edge\u2014burdened by debt, a sick child, and a broken family. Since his wife left, life has fallen into quiet despair. Then, a mysterious letter arrives, signed only 'TG'. One offer: descend into the crypt of Emelin and steal three golden artifacts\u2014in exchange for a life-changing sum of money. With no other choice, he enters the tomb\u2026 and the nightmare begins.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURESSTORY</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Explore creepy places, collect or combine items, read notes and solve puzzles.\u00a0</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/83a52d621412f96ae2ccb92bf102838d.poster.avif?t=1755121603\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/83a52d621412f96ae2ccb92bf102838d.webm?t=1755121603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/83a52d621412f96ae2ccb92bf102838d.mp4?t=1755121603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-<strong>\u00a0\u00a0</strong>Learn when to hide and when to fight, as well as how to fight.\u00a0 </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/004d266f495e78a1c2c05f375a1c89f0.poster.avif?t=1755121603\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/004d266f495e78a1c2c05f375a1c89f0.webm?t=1755121603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/004d266f495e78a1c2c05f375a1c89f0.mp4?t=1755121603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- <strong>Find your way to survive in a dark and unfriendly environment.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "A chilling survival-horror FPS set in a creepy, atmospheric world. Explore a haunted cemetery, descend into a cursed crypt, and face the horrors that lurk below. Hide, fight, survive\u2014do you have what it takes to make it out alive?",
